  "text": "There are 60 minutes in an hour.\n\nRegarding renewable energy, solar panels use a process called the photovoltaic effect to generate electricity. When sunlight hits materials like silicon, the energy from light particles (photons) excites electrons, causing them to move. This movement creates an electrical current that can be used as power. This technology helps reduce our dependence on fossil fuels and lowers greenhouse gas emissions."
